    <briefdescription>
<para>Holds a source to fetch next tuples and a last fetched tuple to compare the node against other nodes. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The main reason why this structure is separated from a merge source is that a heap node can not be a member of several heaps.</para><para>The second reason is that it allows to encapsulate all heap related logic inside this compilation unit, without any traces in externally visible structures. </para>    </detaileddescription>
